units.english_cohort_translation:
Blessed is he whose helper is the God of Jacob, whose hope is in the Lord his God,
Who made heaven and earth, the sea, and all that is in them;
Who keeps truth unto eternity, Who executes judgment for the wronged, Who gives food to the hungry. (cont. on fol. 98r)

